    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Corruption spreads through a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point on the ground you can see within range. Each creature in the area makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, it takes 2d6 Necrotic damage and is cursed until the end of your next turn; while it is cursed, it takes an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage whenever you deal damage to it with an attack roll. On a success, it takes half as much damage only.</p>",
